sequenceDiagram
    participant Engineer
    participant EpicDesign as epic-E{N}-design.md
    participant Status as 00-status.md
    participant VerifyGate as verify_gate.py
    participant SliceTable as slice_table.py
    participant Assessment as design-mode/assessment.json

    Engineer->>EpicDesign: Write retrospective design for epic E{N}
    EpicDesign-->>Engineer: Opens with "gate did not run before implementation"

    loop for each of the five multi-slice plugin-split epics
        Engineer->>EpicDesign: Author epic-E1..E6-design.md
    end

    Engineer->>Status: Mark Gate 4b APPROVED (retrospective)
    Status-->>Engineer: 00-status.md records qualifier, not silent pass

    Engineer->>VerifyGate: Run verify_gate.py against docs/plans/cobuilder-family/
    VerifyGate->>Status: Read Gate 4a/4b/4c status lines
    VerifyGate->>SliceTable: Parse 04-slices.md via slice_table.py
    SliceTable-->>VerifyGate: Slice counts per epic
    VerifyGate->>EpicDesign: Check a design doc exists for each multi-slice epic
    EpicDesign-->>VerifyGate: Five retrospective designs found

    alt All three sub-steps satisfied
        VerifyGate-->>Engineer: Exit 0, Gate 4 passes honestly
    else A sub-step still pending
        VerifyGate-->>Engineer: Exit 1, names the missing sub-step
    end

    Engineer->>Assessment: Add missing retrospective assessment
    Assessment-->>Engineer: stage "retrospective", findings kind observation/drift, never prediction
